WEBVTT

00:01.547 --> 00:04.657
<b>"When the world reaches saturation,</b>

00:04.657 --> 00:06.617
<b>the King of Ruin will appear.</b>

00:07.917 --> 00:11.327
<b>He will bring ruin to any and all,</b>

00:11.957 --> 00:15.047
<b>forcing all to start over from scratch."</b>

00:21.277 --> 00:24.347
<b>Are you prepared
to return to the king?</b>

00:24.347 --> 00:25.337
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:26.007 --> 00:30.637
<b>We've already accepted charity 
from the King of Ruin.</b>

00:30.977 --> 00:34.807
<b>We don't know what he'll 
demand in return later.</b>

00:34.807 --> 00:37.307
<b>No way. He never said anything about that.</b>

00:37.917 --> 00:39.847
<b>Can you be certain he won't?</b>

00:39.847 --> 00:44.247
<b>An evil being demanding recompense 
is just the way of the world.</b>

00:44.247 --> 00:46.937
<b>However, it's also true</b>

00:46.937 --> 00:50.447
<b>that we must borrow the king's 
power in order to survive.</b>

00:50.777 --> 00:51.527
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:51.527 --> 00:53.127
<b>Even if we were to leave this forest,</b>

00:53.127 --> 00:57.067
<b>we'd just be going back to our vagabond life 
and struggling to find tomorrow's meal.</b>

00:57.067 --> 00:58.917
<b>If we did that, then eventually...</b>

00:59.367 --> 01:01.857
<b>We came to the Dark Continent</b>

01:01.857 --> 01:05.067
<b>in search of a realm where 
we wouldn't be persecuted,</b>

01:05.067 --> 01:08.137
<b>but this might be our last chance.</b>

01:10.007 --> 01:11.657
<b>Let's go.</b>

01:11.657 --> 01:13.317
<b>The fate of our people</b>

01:13.317 --> 01:15.227
<b>rests on our shoulders.</b>

02:55.577 --> 02:57.037
Let's Announce the Founding of Mynoghra

02:59.657 --> 03:01.277
<b>Long-legged Bug,</b>

03:01.277 --> 03:03.427
<b>I'm in the middle of 
speaking with King Takuto.</b>

03:03.427 --> 03:07.207
<b>Oh, I ordered it to return to us for a bit.</b>

03:09.087 --> 03:10.687
<b>I see.</b>

03:10.687 --> 03:13.137
<b>Apparently, the Dark Elves are coming.</b>

03:13.137 --> 03:14.087
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:14.087 --> 03:19.427
<b>The food you provided them before was too 
much for them to take home all at once.</b>

03:19.427 --> 03:22.327
<b>Having people with a different 
culture and ideology nearby</b>

03:22.327 --> 03:24.377
<b>can lead to conflict.</b>

03:24.377 --> 03:28.397
<b>I'd love to have them take the remaining 
food and leave promptly, but...</b>

03:28.747 --> 03:30.857
<b>Is there something concerning you?</b>

03:31.547 --> 03:32.467
<b>Well...</b>

03:32.467 --> 03:34.587
<b>I'm bad at communicating,</b>

03:34.587 --> 03:36.827
<b>so I'm not sure I'll be able 
to handle negotiations well.</b>

03:37.287 --> 03:38.707
<b>King Takuto....</b>

03:39.787 --> 03:43.027
<b>Then I'll take charge of 
the negotiations for you!</b>

03:43.027 --> 03:46.747
<b>That would help show off your 
majesty as our king as well!</b>

03:47.117 --> 03:48.567
<b>I'm grateful for the offer,</b>

03:48.567 --> 03:49.587
<b>but are you sure?</b>

03:50.377 --> 03:52.657
<b>If you need anything, all 
you have to do is ask.</b>

03:52.657 --> 03:55.707
<b>Or do you think I'm not 
capable of handling it?</b>

03:55.707 --> 03:57.527
<b>No, I'd never think that.</b>

03:57.527 --> 03:58.807
<b>I'm counting on you, Atou.</b>

03:59.137 --> 04:02.227
<b>Your wish is my command, my king.</b>

04:03.727 --> 04:09.187
<b>We're truly grateful that you have granted 
us the honor of an audience.</b>

04:09.527 --> 04:15.407
<b>I am the Elder of the Dark 
Elves, Moltar Cordal Mazaram.</b>

04:15.767 --> 04:18.917
<b>Good. It seems you know how 
to show proper respect.</b>

04:18.917 --> 04:20.967
<b>You have something you wish to say, yes?</b>

04:20.967 --> 04:22.367
<b>Then speak now.</b>

04:22.367 --> 04:23.857
<b>Yes.</b>

04:23.857 --> 04:28.457
<b>I offer you our greatest gratitude 
for granting my people food.</b>

04:28.457 --> 04:32.587
<b>May I please ask for the honor 
of knowing your great name?</b>

04:33.657 --> 04:35.967
<b>His name, you say?</b>

04:40.207 --> 04:44.457
<b>Ira Takuto, the Lord of 
the Apocalypse, Ruler of Ruin!</b>

04:44.457 --> 04:46.407
<b>That is his grand, esteemed name!</b>

04:46.407 --> 04:49.857
<b>Be sure to address him as 
King Ira or King Ira Takuto!</b>

04:51.647 --> 04:54.467
<b>Also, my name is Atou.</b>

04:54.467 --> 04:57.257
<b>I'm of lesser status than King Takuto,</b>

04:57.257 --> 04:59.657
<b>so be sure not to use the same title with me.</b>

05:00.137 --> 05:02.597
<b>King Ira Takuto, Lady Atou.</b>

05:02.597 --> 05:08.877
<b>I promise we will engrave your esteemed 
names into the souls of our people.</b>

05:09.257 --> 05:12.337
<b><i>It seems like things are going well so far.</i></b>

05:12.337 --> 05:15.317
<b>Then you may take your food and leave.</b>

05:15.317 --> 05:17.587
<b>Much of it will not keep for long, after all.</b>

05:17.927 --> 05:19.457
<b>P-Please wait!</b>

05:19.457 --> 05:24.347
<b>How can we repay you for your king's 
great kindness in saving our people?</b>

05:24.347 --> 05:25.827
<b>That's unnecessary.</b>

05:25.827 --> 05:30.507
<b>I doubt you would be capable of preparing 
an offering that would satisfy my king,</b>

05:30.507 --> 05:32.357
<b>and you lack the resources to do so, yes?</b>

05:32.357 --> 05:34.817
<b>W-Well...</b>

05:36.567 --> 05:38.847
<b>What an indecisive attitude.</b>

05:38.847 --> 05:41.867
<b>Are you plotting something?</b>

05:42.707 --> 05:45.077
<b>H-Heavens no!</b>

05:45.887 --> 05:49.987
<b><i>Things are looking incredibly bad now.</i></b>

05:49.987 --> 05:51.337
<b>Atou, a moment.</b>

05:51.337 --> 05:53.297
<b>Yes, King Takuto!</b>

05:53.737 --> 05:57.777
<b>About our negotiations...</b>

05:58.507 --> 06:00.817
<b>King Takuto!</b>

06:00.817 --> 06:04.097
<b>Those two suck at negotiations!</b>

06:04.097 --> 06:05.477
<b>Now, now.</b>

06:05.477 --> 06:08.187
<b>If we leave them alone, 
they'll just get in your way!</b>

06:08.187 --> 06:09.977
<b>We should massacre them at once!</b>

06:09.977 --> 06:14.937
<b>Their necks would look great strung 
up on pillars, King Takuto!</b>

06:14.937 --> 06:16.347
<b>Hold on, hold on!</b>

06:16.347 --> 06:17.137
<b>Look...</b>

06:17.137 --> 06:20.907
<b>I'm sure they want to build a 
mutually beneficial relationship.</b>

06:21.667 --> 06:24.237
<b>Mutually beneficial, you say?</b>

06:24.537 --> 06:25.317
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:25.317 --> 06:27.727
<b>Let's accept a price 
they'd be satisfied with</b>

06:27.727 --> 06:30.477
<b>instead of just granting it for nothing.</b>

06:30.477 --> 06:33.207
<b>I think that would reassure them as well.</b>

06:36.167 --> 06:37.757
<b>Rejoice!</b>

06:37.757 --> 06:42.887
<b>My king has said he is willing to accept 
your offering in exchange for his charity.</b>

06:43.227 --> 06:44.137
<b>Oh!</b>

06:45.587 --> 06:48.477
<b>We're grateful for your 
generous consideration.</b>

06:48.777 --> 06:50.417
<b><i>How interesting.</i></b>

06:50.417 --> 06:53.547
<b><i>That old man was wary that 
there was some kind of catch</i></b>

06:53.547 --> 06:56.437
<b><i>because our alignment is evil.</i></b>

06:57.017 --> 06:58.487
<b>I see.</b>

06:59.557 --> 07:01.347
<b>What a fool you are.</b>

07:01.347 --> 07:05.297
<b>Thinking of King Takuto as one would 
a wicked ghost or an evil specter.</b>

07:05.297 --> 07:08.027
<b>N-No! I would never do such a thing!</b>

07:08.027 --> 07:09.287
<b>Silence!</b>

07:09.837 --> 07:12.277
<b>Still, what price?</b>

07:12.277 --> 07:13.537
<b>A price...</b>

07:13.677 --> 07:14.957
<b>A price...</b>

07:16.017 --> 07:18.257
<b>What do I do, King Takuto?</b>

07:21.087 --> 07:23.047
<b>The world beyond...</b>

07:24.797 --> 07:27.207
<b>You shall tell us of the 
world beyond this forest!</b>

07:27.207 --> 07:28.887
<b>That is what the king desires!</b>

07:28.887 --> 07:29.697
<b>Oh!</b>

07:29.697 --> 07:35.107
<b>In that case, I shall offer to share all 
that I have heard and witnessed myself!</b>

07:35.107 --> 07:36.357
<b>Very good.</b>

07:36.357 --> 07:38.367
<b>Then once your pact has been fulfilled,</b>

07:38.367 --> 07:40.817
<b>be sure to leave this forest promptly.</b>

07:42.747 --> 07:44.277
<b><i>He's shaken.</i></b>

07:44.277 --> 07:47.827
<b><i>This one's much easier 
to read than the old man.</i></b>

07:48.187 --> 07:51.777
<b>Nothing would grant us more 
joy than receiving permission</b>

07:51.777 --> 07:54.457
<b>to stay in this forest 
where the king presides.</b>

07:54.457 --> 07:56.167
<b>We cannot permit that.</b>

07:56.167 --> 07:59.287
<b>Furthermore, if you do not wish to 
lose the lives that have been saved,</b>

07:59.287 --> 08:02.167
<b>then you will not speak of 
what happened here to others.</b>

08:02.167 --> 08:03.277
<b>But we—!</b>

08:03.277 --> 08:04.377
<b>Gia.</b>

08:04.967 --> 08:06.447
<b>If that is what the king wishes,</b>

08:06.447 --> 08:08.597
<b>then we shall simply obey.</b>

08:10.567 --> 08:13.397
<b>Then, mighty King Ira Takuto,</b>

08:13.397 --> 08:17.557
<b>I offer our gratitude for 
granting us this audience.</b>

08:21.027 --> 08:23.257
<b><i>Is this the right thing to do?</i></b>

08:23.257 --> 08:25.377
<b><i>If I cast them out like this,</i></b>

08:25.377 --> 08:28.417
<b><i>there's a good chance they'll 
just collapse elsewhere.</i></b>

08:28.417 --> 08:31.037
<b><i>There has to be a way to overcome this.</i></b>

08:32.087 --> 08:33.247
<b><i>I know!</i></b>

08:33.707 --> 08:35.117
<b>Hey, you two.</b>

08:37.847 --> 08:39.837
<b>You should become my citizens.</b>

08:41.767 --> 08:42.787
<b>U-Uh...</b>

08:42.787 --> 08:45.107
<b>I'll consult with my king!</b>

08:46.047 --> 08:48.217
<b>Wh-What are you trying to do?</b>

08:49.007 --> 08:52.137
<b>I was thinking of using the Refugee system.</b>

08:52.137 --> 08:53.307
<b>Huh?!</b>

08:53.307 --> 08:57.607
<b>Dark Elves are neither good 
nor evil by default.</b>

08:57.607 --> 09:01.507
<b>But if we accept them into our 
civilization as refugees...</b>

09:00.317 --> 09:03.147
m 0 0 l 250 0 250 113 0 113

09:00.317 --> 09:03.147
m 0 0 l 150 0 150 2 0 2

09:00.317 --> 09:03.147
<b>Head Warrior Gia</b>

09:00.317 --> 09:03.147
<b>Dark Elf</b>

09:00.317 --> 09:03.147
<b>Racial Bonuses
 Forest Bonus +15%
 Darkvision Bonus +5%
 Cold Resistance Bonus +10%
 Fertility Bonus -5%
 Food Production Bonus -5%</b>

09:00.317 --> 09:03.147
<b>Description</b>

09:00.317 --> 09:03.147
Dark Elves are a neutral race descended from Ancient 
Elves. They have a talent for assassinations and magic
of the Dark element, while their racial traits include a
 Forest bonus, Darkvision bonus, and Cold Resistance
 bonus. However, they lack the talent for Bows and Magic
 possessed by Elves, ultimately demanding
 a different play style.

09:01.507 --> 09:03.147
<b>then assuming it works like in the game,</b>

09:03.147 --> 09:04.317
Unaffiliated

09:03.147 --> 09:07.277
<b>Head Warrior Gia</b>

09:03.147 --> 09:07.277
<b>Nationality:</b>

09:03.147 --> 09:07.277
<b>they should become evil beings just like us.</b>

09:04.317 --> 09:07.277
Mynoghra

09:07.277 --> 09:12.617
<b>It's true that it's possible for different 
evil-aligned beings to coexist,</b>

09:12.617 --> 09:18.087
<b>but they're very different from Mynoghra's 
main citizenry, the Homunculi.</b>

09:18.087 --> 09:20.377
<b>There's still a risk of them clashing.</b>

09:20.927 --> 09:22.347
<b>It's true, that's a risk.</b>

09:22.347 --> 09:24.787
<b>But I want you to remember.</b>

09:24.787 --> 09:26.967
<b>Remember how the Homunculi look.</b>

09:27.087 --> 09:32.057
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 65 0 65

09:27.087 --> 09:32.057
m 0 0 l 180 0 180 2 0 2

09:27.087 --> 09:32.057
<b>Homunculi</b>

09:27.087 --> 09:32.057
<b>Racial Bonuses:
 Population Growth Bonus +20%
 Mana Production Bonus -20%
 Resource Production Bonus +20%
 Food Production Bonus +20%
 Research Bonus -20%</b>

09:27.477 --> 09:28.527
<b>Atou,</b>

09:28.527 --> 09:32.057
<b>can you handle life with
 only those for citizens?</b>

09:32.057 --> 09:33.567
<b>That's right.</b>

09:33.567 --> 09:36.687
<b>It's impossible to hold a proper 
conversation with the Homunculi too.</b>

09:36.687 --> 09:39.267
<b>That appearance is bad for the mind as well.</b>

09:39.267 --> 09:40.957
<b>So you see where I'm coming from?</b>

09:40.957 --> 09:43.237
<b>It'd be a big help if you 
could convey it well for me.</b>

09:45.137 --> 09:48.067
<b>Our king intends to found a nation here soon.</b>

09:48.067 --> 09:50.477
<b>If you are willing to become its citizens,</b>

09:50.477 --> 09:53.037
<b>then he will promise to safeguard you.</b>

09:53.927 --> 09:56.627
<b>P-Please forgive my rudeness,</b>

09:56.627 --> 09:58.997
<b>but what would become of us 
if we become his citizens?</b>

09:58.997 --> 10:01.977
<b>You would be promised eternal happiness.</b>

10:01.977 --> 10:03.847
<b>Or so I would like to say,</b>

10:03.847 --> 10:07.217
<b>but I imagine that is not 
what you wish to know.</b>

10:07.637 --> 10:09.107
<b>To be frank,</b>

10:09.107 --> 10:11.177
<b>you would become evil beings.</b>

10:12.287 --> 10:15.847
<b>You're free to choose 
your fate for yourselves.</b>

10:16.827 --> 10:17.867
<b>However,</b>

10:17.867 --> 10:20.557
<b>if I may add my own personal opinion,</b>

10:21.527 --> 10:24.317
<b>it's more fun than you'd 
expect on our side.</b>

10:30.527 --> 10:33.647
<b>King Takuto, please watch your step.</b>

10:33.647 --> 10:34.517
<b>Thank you.</b>

10:34.517 --> 10:35.487
<b>I'm okay.</b>

10:35.487 --> 10:38.767
<b>Still, it took them quite a 
while to make up their minds</b>

10:38.767 --> 10:40.957
<b>to become our citizens.</b>

10:40.957 --> 10:42.407
<b>Well,</b>

10:42.407 --> 10:46.667
<b>I think anyone would think it over if they were 
told it would turn them into evil beings.</b>

10:46.667 --> 10:51.187
<b>They knew from the start what 
their best option would be though.</b>

10:51.187 --> 10:53.957
<b>Oh, King Takuto, I can see it.</b>

10:53.957 --> 10:55.947
<b>It's the Dark Elves' camp.</b>

10:58.137 --> 10:59.227
<b>Everyone!</b>

10:59.227 --> 11:00.597
<b>The king has arrived!</b>

11:16.697 --> 11:18.847
<b>Don't look at him directly!</b>

11:18.847 --> 11:20.067
<b>It's disrespectful!</b>

11:22.417 --> 11:25.917
<b>My king, it seems all 
the Dark Elves are here.</b>

11:26.957 --> 11:30.297
<b>Now, we hereby accept all of you Dark Elves</b>

11:30.297 --> 11:34.047
<b>as citizens of our nation, Mynoghra!</b>

11:34.047 --> 11:39.847
"Refugee"

11:34.047 --> 11:39.847
Would you like to accept 
this group of Dark Elves

11:35.347 --> 11:39.847
into the nation of 
Mynoghra

11:37.347 --> 11:39.847
as refugees?

11:40.327 --> 11:42.437
<b>King Takuto, are you certain?</b>

11:42.437 --> 11:45.127
<b>Yeah. All the conditions have been met.</b>

11:45.127 --> 11:49.067
<b>Now, let's formally announce 
the founding of Mynoghra.</b>

11:49.067 --> 11:55.527
Your nation has been founded due to the increase in citizenship.

11:50.317 --> 11:55.527
All hail the mighty commander

11:52.317 --> 11:55.527
and Mynoghra!

11:56.667 --> 11:57.667
<b>Okay.</b>

11:57.667 --> 11:58.987
<b>Glad to have you.</b>

11:58.987 --> 12:00.817
<b>Congratulations!</b>

12:00.817 --> 12:03.707
<b>You all are now citizens of Mynoghra.</b>

12:04.217 --> 12:06.307
<b>Your happiness and safety</b>

12:06.307 --> 12:10.627
<b>shall be guaranteed under our 
mighty ruler, King Ira Takuto.</b>

12:11.097 --> 12:13.497
<b>Is that it?</b>

12:13.497 --> 12:15.347
<b><i>They said we would become evil,</i></b>

12:15.347 --> 12:17.887
<b><i>but I'm not sensing any changes—</i></b>

12:21.477 --> 12:25.117
<b><i>I can feel the hatred rising 
up from deep within me.</i></b>

12:25.117 --> 12:30.527
<b><i>Those who persecuted us, hurt us, and 
scoffed at us like we were worthless!</i></b>

12:31.167 --> 12:32.317
<b>I hate them!</b>

12:32.897 --> 12:35.187
<b>I hate them all!</b>

12:35.187 --> 12:37.317
<b>I hate all living beings!</b>

12:43.087 --> 12:46.257
<b><i>The rage and the hatred won't stop!</i></b>

12:46.257 --> 12:47.117
<b><i>I hate them!</i></b>

12:47.117 --> 12:48.067
<b><i>I'm angry at them!</i></b>

12:48.067 --> 12:49.517
<b><i>This is painful!</i></b>

12:49.517 --> 12:50.617
<b>Are you okay?</b>

12:53.767 --> 12:54.887
<b>My king...</b>

12:55.797 --> 12:57.097
<b>I see.</b>

12:57.097 --> 13:00.267
<b>So this is the joy of being cared for.</b>

13:02.337 --> 13:04.207
<b>King Ira Takuto!</b>

13:04.207 --> 13:06.477
<b>Our mighty king!</b>

13:06.477 --> 13:08.147
<b>Yeah!</b>

13:08.147 --> 13:10.357
<b>King Ira Takuto!</b>

13:08.887 --> 13:11.357
<b>Our wonderful king!</b>

13:14.717 --> 13:16.227
<b>Oh!</b>

13:18.847 --> 13:23.577
<b><i>A few days have passed since I 
established the kingdom of Mynoghra.</i></b>

13:25.057 --> 13:26.287
<b>It's checkmate.</b>

13:26.567 --> 13:29.877
<b>Huh? What's the matter, King Takuto?</b>

13:29.877 --> 13:31.447
<b>Look.</b>

13:31.447 --> 13:35.027
<b>This is the map of the continent that 
you received from Elder Moltar, right?</b>

13:35.027 --> 13:36.057
<b>This is...</b>

13:38.387 --> 13:41.847
<b>We got such a shitty starting position!</b>

13:41.847 --> 13:45.807
<b>El-Nah
 Alliance of Elementals</b>

13:41.847 --> 13:55.027
<b>Holy Kingdom of Qualia</b>

13:42.617 --> 13:46.047
<b>There are already two large 
nations on this continent.</b>

13:46.047 --> 13:48.487
<b>One is the Holy Kingdom of Qualia.</b>

13:48.487 --> 13:52.337
<b>It's a nation of humans who 
worship the Holy God Arlos.</b>

13:52.337 --> 13:55.297
<b>Ugh, that means a hardcore 
good alignment, doesn't it?</b>

13:55.027 --> 14:00.407
<b>El-Nah
 Alliance of Elementals</b>

13:55.297 --> 13:58.727
<b>Ack, and this one is a nation 
of Elves who worship nature.</b>

13:58.727 --> 14:00.457
<b>That's also good-aligned for sure.</b>

14:00.457 --> 14:03.577
<b>If they manage to discover our evil nation...</b>

14:00.737 --> 14:06.707
<b>Mynoghra</b>

14:03.577 --> 14:06.707
<b>It'll be the cliche, "Good 
day, sir. Now die!" won't it?!</b>

14:06.707 --> 14:08.347
<b>As Mynoghra stands now,</b>

14:08.347 --> 14:12.417
<b>we don't have the military strength 
to oppose these two dominant nations.</b>

14:12.417 --> 14:13.937
<b>King Takuto!</b>

14:13.937 --> 14:15.447
<b>To make things worse,</b>

14:15.447 --> 14:19.687
<b>these Accursed Lands don't have a single 
natural resource we can harvest!</b>

14:18.287 --> 14:19.687
<b>I know!</b>

14:19.687 --> 14:23.177
<b>It's so bad that trying to express this 
as a difficulty level is a fool's errand.</b>

14:23.517 --> 14:25.727
<b>Well, at least it's not all bad news.</b>

14:25.727 --> 14:29.917
<b>Normally, Mynoghra would
struggle to produce Research, right?</b>

14:29.917 --> 14:33.187
<b>Our citizens, the Homunculi, 
are fairly stupid after all.</b>

14:33.187 --> 14:37.647
<b>Though it's good that their Fertility is high 
and their Happiness doesn't decline easily.</b>

14:37.647 --> 14:42.617
<b>Uh-huh. Though this time, the Dark 
Elves should help cover that weakness.</b>

14:42.917 --> 14:44.157
<b>I see.</b>

14:47.777 --> 14:52.417
<b>It would seem the Dark Elves are here
to report on the world beyond again.</b>

14:54.037 --> 14:56.307
<b>Good day to you, my king.</b>

14:56.307 --> 14:58.117
<b>Lady Atou as well.</b>

14:58.117 --> 15:00.887
<b>My king, I, Gia, am here as well!</b>

15:00.887 --> 15:04.007
<b>Today I have brought my aide, Emle, with me.</b>

15:04.667 --> 15:05.967
<b>I'm Emle.</b>

15:06.377 --> 15:10.817
<b>Emle is an intelligent woman, and knows much
 about legends and about other nations.</b>

15:10.817 --> 15:12.307
<b>I believe she'll be helpful.</b>

15:13.237 --> 15:16.867
<b>Our king is very satisfied 
with your dedication.</b>

15:16.867 --> 15:19.787
<b>Thank you! I am grateful for the praise.</b>

15:19.787 --> 15:22.317
<b>You need not remain so formal.</b>

15:22.317 --> 15:24.777
<b>Our king is not a fan of ceremony.</b>

15:25.777 --> 15:28.617
<b>If that is what our king wishes.</b>

15:28.617 --> 15:31.447
<b>Now, on to our plans for the future...</b>

15:31.447 --> 15:36.647
<b>We'll have you work in key positions 
for the administration of Mynoghra.</b>

15:36.647 --> 15:39.337
<b>This is our king's decision, 
so it cannot be overturned.</b>

15:40.387 --> 15:43.687
<b>Elder Moltar, you shall focus 
on managing affairs of state.</b>

15:43.687 --> 15:45.607
<b>We've heard you can use magic as well,</b>

15:45.607 --> 15:46.917
<b>so we have great expectations.</b>

15:46.917 --> 15:48.567
<b>I accept this post.</b>

15:48.567 --> 15:50.667
<b>Gia, you will continue 
to serve as Head Warrior,</b>

15:50.667 --> 15:53.207
<b>so please command Mynoghra's forces.</b>

15:53.207 --> 15:55.647
<b>We leave recruiting up to you as well.</b>

15:56.157 --> 15:57.807
<b>I accept this post!</b>

15:57.807 --> 15:59.107
<b>If our king commands it,</b>

15:59.107 --> 16:01.207
<b>I'll swiftly slaughter any foe,</b>

16:01.207 --> 16:03.777
<b>skewer them, and line their 
corpses up on display!</b>

16:03.777 --> 16:06.277
<b>What? That's scary.</b>

16:06.717 --> 16:07.387
<b>Huh?</b>

16:08.177 --> 16:10.307
<b>War is barbaric.</b>

16:10.857 --> 16:12.767
<b>Our king prefers peace.</b>

16:12.767 --> 16:13.867
<b>Be sure to remember that!</b>

16:14.157 --> 16:15.537
<b>Y-Yes!</b>

16:16.047 --> 16:18.877
<b><i>Why would the King of Ruin be a pacifist?</i></b>

16:22.247 --> 16:24.957
<b>First, be sure to get plenty of rest.</b>

16:24.957 --> 16:26.547
<b>Once your health has recovered,</b>

16:26.547 --> 16:28.967
<b>we'll have you start constructing homes.</b>

16:29.567 --> 16:31.597
<b>You have our deepest gratitude.</b>

16:31.597 --> 16:34.167
<b>Unlike Gia, who only prides 
himself on strength,</b>

16:34.167 --> 16:37.767
<b>my knowledge shall prove useful at once.</b>

16:37.767 --> 16:38.767
<b>Hmph!</b>

16:38.767 --> 16:40.977
<b><i>That damn old man!</i></b>

16:40.977 --> 16:46.037
<b>U-Unlike this old man, I'm 
brimming with vitality!</b>

16:46.037 --> 16:47.687
<b>I don't need any rest!</b>

16:47.687 --> 16:49.577
<b>I-I'll work hard too!</b>

16:49.577 --> 16:50.677
<b>Hmm.</b>

16:50.677 --> 16:54.647
<b>King Takuto, it would 
seem they're workaholics.</b>

16:54.647 --> 16:56.957
<b>Shall we command them to 
gather resources for now?</b>

16:57.227 --> 16:58.777
<b>Hmm...</b>

16:58.777 --> 16:59.947
<b>I know!</b>

16:59.947 --> 17:02.207
<b>What about improving the Terrain?</b>

17:02.207 --> 17:04.417
<b>Right! There was that option!</b>

17:04.957 --> 17:08.057
<b>Elder Moltar, would it possible
 for you to procure lumber</b>

17:08.057 --> 17:10.637
<b>while leaving enough of the forest intact?</b>

17:10.637 --> 17:11.967
<b>Leave that to me.</b>

17:11.967 --> 17:14.807
<b>We're also a people who 
make the forest our home.</b>

17:14.807 --> 17:18.247
<b>If you're planning to construct 
buildings using big trees,</b>

17:18.247 --> 17:20.477
<b>then I believe we can 
fulfill our king's wishes.</b>

17:20.787 --> 17:22.027
<b>Oh!</b>

17:22.027 --> 17:24.317
<b>That's quite promising to hear.</b>

17:24.647 --> 17:26.567
<b><i>He's the King of Ruin,</i></b>

17:26.567 --> 17:29.237
<b><i>and he's not destroying the forest?</i></b>

17:29.607 --> 17:30.717
<b>Work hard!</b>

17:30.717 --> 17:32.487
<b>Don't forget to Reforest it too!</b>

17:34.627 --> 17:36.817
<b>I'd like to ask a question.</b>

17:36.817 --> 17:39.537
<b>What manner of action is Reforesting?</b>

17:39.537 --> 17:42.717
<b>Huh? You don't know about Reforesting?</b>

17:42.717 --> 17:44.837
<b>Elder Moltar? Emle?</b>

17:48.297 --> 17:56.767
<b>Magic Technology</b>

17:48.817 --> 17:53.307
<b><i>From what I'm hearing, the tech 
level for people of this world</i></b>

17:49.007 --> 17:56.767
<b>Fortress Building</b>

17:53.307 --> 17:56.767
<b><i>should be somewhere around Fortress Building.</i></b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
Magic Technology

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Troops Allocation Magic</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Netherworld Dolls</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Military Magic</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Strategic Offensive Magic</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Four Major Elements</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Floating Weapons</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Genetic Enhancement Magic</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Six Major Elements</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Special Magic Source</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Dimension Summoning</b>

17:56.767 --> 18:04.277
<b>Terrain Manipulation</b>

18:04.807 --> 18:08.277
<b>Are you familiar with the terms "Military 
Magic" and "the Six Major Elements"?</b>

18:08.277 --> 18:10.277
<b>I know of the Four Major Elements.</b>

18:10.277 --> 18:13.197
Four Major Elements

18:10.567 --> 18:13.197
<b>That's a fundamental concept in magic.</b>

18:13.197 --> 18:17.787
<b>Military Magic is also a term I've 
never heard any other nations using.</b>

18:17.787 --> 18:19.307
<b>I see.</b>

18:17.787 --> 18:26.757
<b>Agriculture</b>

18:17.787 --> 18:26.757
<b>Six Major Elements</b>

18:18.957 --> 18:26.757
<b>Reforesting</b>

18:19.307 --> 18:23.457
<b>I guess this world hasn't even reached the 
Magic Technology level of the Six Major Elements.</b>

18:23.457 --> 18:26.757
<b>They're oddly behind 
compared to their other technologies.</b>

18:27.077 --> 18:28.307
<b>Does this mean...</b>

18:28.307 --> 18:33.967
<b>that our magic technology is far poorer 
than our king thought it would be?</b>

18:33.967 --> 18:35.457
<b>Exactly right.</b>

18:35.457 --> 18:36.597
<b>Though, on the other hand,</b>

18:36.597 --> 18:40.297
<b>that also means we have a chance to get 
ahead of other nations once we advance it.</b>

18:40.297 --> 18:41.437
<b>Oh my!</b>

18:41.437 --> 18:44.437
<b>Whoops, I'm getting off track.</b>

18:44.437 --> 18:47.677
<b>Reforesting is the practice of planting 
trees where you harvested lumber</b>

18:47.677 --> 18:49.727
<b>in order to maintain the environment.</b>

18:49.727 --> 18:52.407
<b>It's an important step to secure resources.</b>

18:52.407 --> 18:57.437
<b>I don't believe our magic technology 
has anything to do with growing trees?</b>

18:57.437 --> 19:04.307
<b>True, it usually takes several centuries 
for them to mature once harvested.</b>

19:04.307 --> 19:05.297
<b>Are you suggesting...</b>

19:05.297 --> 19:06.307
<b>Yes.</b>

19:06.307 --> 19:11.667
<b>Reforesting is a technology that uses the 
major elements to accelerate their growth.</b>

19:11.667 --> 19:13.257
<b>And this is also</b>

19:13.257 --> 19:16.757
<b>wisdom born from our mighty 
king, King Ira Takuto!</b>

19:16.757 --> 19:17.217
<b>Huh?!</b>

19:17.217 --> 19:18.367
<b>Truly?!</b>

19:18.367 --> 19:19.277
<b>Yes!</b>

19:19.277 --> 19:22.727
<b>Our king is a hundred times more 
incredible than you imagine!</b>

19:23.047 --> 19:25.647
<b><i>Th-That's a huge lie!</i></b>

19:25.647 --> 19:28.797
<b>The knowledge born from our king 
covers many different areas.</b>

19:28.797 --> 19:34.367
<b>Do you understand how blessed you are 
to receive the grace of our king?!</b>

19:36.157 --> 19:38.827
<b><i>My stomach hurts from the pressure.</i></b>

19:39.117 --> 19:43.917
<b>Then the apples we received earlier 
are food our king created too?!</b>

19:43.917 --> 19:46.257
<b>Yes! Yes, they are!</b>

19:46.257 --> 19:49.417
<b>I especially love the grapes 
created by our king!</b>

19:49.417 --> 19:52.427
<b><i>You're cut off from grapes for a while!</i></b>

19:52.427 --> 19:56.187
<b>Oh, grapes! That purple fruit, right?!</b>

19:56.187 --> 19:57.937
<b>They had seeds, so I tried planting them,</b>

19:57.937 --> 19:59.457
<b>and they're already sprouting!</b>

19:59.457 --> 20:01.267
<b>I can't wait until they're fully grown!</b>

20:02.277 --> 20:05.587
<b>Umm, did you say you planted the grape seeds?</b>

20:05.587 --> 20:07.977
<b>And they've sprouted?</b>

20:07.977 --> 20:10.187
<b>U-Uh?</b>

20:10.537 --> 20:11.737
<b><i>That's right!</i></b>

20:11.737 --> 20:13.817
<b><i>Why didn't I notice it sooner?</i></b>

20:14.507 --> 20:17.507
<b><i>The food I created 
was from the modern world!</i></b>

20:17.507 --> 20:22.077
<b><i>That means I can use Emergency Production to 
create things that didn't exist in the game!</i></b>

20:24.177 --> 20:25.627
<b><i>Emergency Production!</i></b>

20:30.967 --> 20:32.467
<b><i>I knew it!</i></b>

20:33.367 --> 20:38.887
<b><i>With this power, I can create 
gunpowder, base metals, and even oil.</i></b>

20:38.887 --> 20:42.267
<b><i>It requires vast amounts of Mana,</i></b>

20:42.267 --> 20:46.347
<b><i>but it's obvious how overpowered that is!</i></b>

20:51.527 --> 20:55.777
<b>U-Umm, was that a bad thing?</b>

20:55.777 --> 20:58.237
<b>No, it was something we overlooked.</b>

20:58.237 --> 21:01.687
<b>You've truly done good work.</b>

21:02.617 --> 21:07.747
Mynoghra has been granted the following National Feature:

21:02.617 --> 21:07.747
Divine Privilege

21:07.787 --> 21:17.927
m 0 0 l 250 0 250 70 0 70

21:07.787 --> 21:17.927
m 0 0 l 150 0 150 2 0 2

21:07.787 --> 21:17.927
<b>Divine Privilege</b>

21:07.787 --> 21:17.927
<b>National Feature</b>

21:07.787 --> 21:17.927
<b>Ira Takuto is able to use Emergency Production
 to produce any food, resource, strategic resource, 
etc. that he is familiar with.</b>

21:11.207 --> 21:17.927
<b>Products of unacquired Technology will have 
an increased Mana Cost based on the complexity
 of the Technology.</b>

21:15.797 --> 21:17.927
Nonexistent Feature data has been selected.

23:02.337 --> 23:06.747
<b>An omen of the apocalypse coming from the 
Accursed Lands on the Dark Continent.</b>

23:06.747 --> 23:08.007
<b>That's...</b>

23:08.007 --> 23:11.077
<b>So this is where you've been, Your Holiness.</b>

23:11.077 --> 23:12.247
<b>Cardinal.</b>

23:12.247 --> 23:13.687
<b>You have good timing.</b>

23:13.687 --> 23:15.457
<b>I wish to speak with you about something.</b>

23:15.457 --> 23:17.057
<b>We must hasten preparations.</b>

23:17.057 --> 23:19.797
<b>Barbarians have appeared 
in the Northern Province.</b>

23:21.527 --> 23:22.607
<b>Let us go.</b>

23:23.127 --> 23:24.657
<b>We cannot ignore this.</b>

23:30.587 --> 23:35.157
<b>Something is beginning 
to happen in this world.</b>
